    "SYS_DIFFICULTY_DESC_LUNA": "[f 0:5 65278][f 2:1 ]For highly advanced players.\n[f 1:1 ]",
    "SYS_DIFFICULTY_INFO_SAFE": "[f 0:5 65278][f 2:1 ]Your party auto-revives after defeat. [f 0:1 43]Your choice of difficulty will not affect the story and can be changed at any time (excluding Merciless).[f 0:1 27]\n[f 1:1 ]",
    "SYS_DIFFICULTY_INFO_EASY": "[f 0:5 65278][f 2:1 ]Low-stress combat. [f 0:1 43]Your choice of difficulty will not affect the story and can be changed at any time (excluding Merciless).[f 0:1 27]\n[f 1:1 ]",
    "SYS_DIFFICULTY_INFO_NORM": "[f 0:5 65278][f 2:1 ]Moderately challenging combat. [f 0:1 43]Your choice of difficulty will not affect the story and can be changed at any time (excluding Merciless).[f 0:1 27]\n[f 1:1 ]",
    "SYS_DIFFICULTY_INFO_HARD": "[f 0:5 65278][f 2:1 ]Significantly challenging combat. [f 0:1 43]Your choice of difficulty will not affect the story and can be changed at any time (excluding Merciless).[f 0:1 27]\n[f 1:1 ]",
    "SYS_DIFFICULTY_INFO_LUNA": "[f 0:5 65278][f 2:1 ]Exceedingly challenging combat. [f 0:1 43]Your choice of difficulty will not affect the story and can be changed at any time, but you cannot return to Merciless once leaving it.[f 0:1 27]\n[f 1:1 ]",
